5. Schema of the DIAN extensions of UBL 2.1

   backend/resources/dian/xsd/maindoc/DIAN_UBL_Structures.xsd

   Published by the DIAN (Dirección de Impuestos y Aduanas Nacionales de Colombia) with the technical
   annex of the electronic sales invoice, version 1.9, which Resolución 000165 of 1 November 2023
   adopts. Article 41 of Ley 23 de 1982 lets anyone reproduce administrative acts as long as the copy
   conforms to the official edition. The file is kept byte for byte as the DIAN toolbox v1.9
   (Caja de herramientas FE - V1.9 - (v2026-2)) ships it:
   https://www.dian.gov.co/impuestos/factura-electronica/Documents/Caja-de-herramientas-FE_V19_v2026.zip

   This project also reproduces, inside its own files, the codes and official names of the annex's
   tables, the codes and messages of its validation rules, and the values of its CUFE and CUDE
   examples: backend/app/Modules/Reference/Enums, simulator/src/rules.ts,
   backend/app/Modules/Dian/Console/DianCheckCommand.php and backend/tests/Unit/Dian/DocumentKeyTest.php.
   They are reproduced as the annex publishes them.

   The rest of the toolbox (its examples, schematron and code lists) is not redistributed here.
   make dian-toolbox downloads it from the DIAN, with its SHA-256, into backend/storage/app/dian-toolbox,
   which git ignores.


